{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07325","headline":"上湖田馆南楼忆朱晏 · 刘长卿","name":"上湖田馆南楼忆朱晏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"漂泊日复日，洞庭今更秋。\n白云如有意，万里望孤舟。\n何事爱成别，空令登此楼。\n天光映波动，月影随江流。\n鹤唳静寒渚，猿啼深夜洲。\n归期诚已促，清景仍相留。\n顷者慕独往，尔来悲远游。\n风波自此去，桂水空离忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07325.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07325","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}